  title: Early Vedic Period
  text: The Early, or Rigvedic, period, about 1500 to 1000 BCE, is known mainly from the Rigveda. Its people lived in the land of seven rivers, the Sapta Sindhu, in present-day Punjab, north-west India and Afghanistan.
